  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0: first release. LINE Login (authorization URL with PKCE and bot_prompt, code exchange, refresh, revoke, token verification, profile, userinfo, friendship status, and a one-call CompleteLoginAsync), the Messaging API (push, multicast, broadcast, reply, quota, bot info, profile, message content, and the full rich menu surface including replacement, aliases and bulk links), typed quick replies with every action kind, message templates with {{variable}} rendering, keyword auto reply over six match modes, and webhook signature verification plus payload parsing. Every expected failure is a Result<T> carrying a stable line.* error code; LINE's own {message, details} error body is parsed into the error data as lineMessage and lineDetails while the HTTP category is preserved, so a 404 stays NotFound and a 429 stays RateLimited. ID tokens are verified locally against the channel secret with HMAC-SHA256 from the BCL. A POST is retried only when a retry key is supplied, since LINE deduplicates on X-Line-Retry-Key. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
